---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  title="Orkaid — Open tools for finance and compliance"
  description="Orkaid is a free, open-source hub of professional tools for finance, accounting, compliance and software."
  pathname="/"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">What is being built</p>
    <h1>Open tools for German e-invoicing.</h1>
    <div class="lead-grid">
      <p>Orkaid is a free, open-source hub of professional tools at the intersection of finance, accounting, compliance and software — built in the open by a practising financial accountant, for the people who actually have to file the documents.</p>
      <p>The first building block is an XRechnung generator conforming to EN 16931 — the starting point, not the boundary of the project.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="tools-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Tools</p>
    <h2 id="tools-heading">The platform foundation is ready.</h2>
    <p>The tool hub is being built step by step. The XRechnung generator itself is not part of this bootstrap.</p>
    <p><a href="/en/tools/">Go to the tool hub</a></p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
